[CHANGE LOG]
timestamp: 2026-06-11T14:11:00+07:00
change_type: code
scope: storebuilder app.js database calls
description: Removed await keywords from dbSaveProducts and dbSaveSession.
reason: Awaiting database writes was blocking UI transition/generation phase when Firestore fails to connect or encounters latency.
impact: Database calls are now fire-and-forget, allowing generation phase to transition instantly.
test_ids_affected: T-032

